  "releaseNotes": "- Added TabInstance.LoadOrCreate() Methods\n    - Added TextBox support for Shift-Enter\n    - Added Confirmation Dialogs for Settings Reset Buttons\n    - Changed TabModel.AddForm() to return an updatable form\n    - Renamed TabInstance.Invoke() to Post()\n    - Renamed ToolButton.Default to IsDefault\n    - Fixed regression for serializer failing to restore all class members when removing previous members\n    - Fixed regression for invalid parsing validations not showing an error\n    - The first validated control that fails will now be focused",
